/T (This project is an AI-based Invoice Processing System that helps in analyzing and categorizing invoices using OCR \(Optical Character Recognition\) and NLP \(Natural Language Processing\) as shown in the flowchart.  The processed data is then displayed on a dashboard with charts and tables, making it easy to understand and manage expenses. This system reduces manual work, saves time, and improves accuracy.)
/E (This project is an AI-based Invoice Processing System that helps in analyzing and categorizing invoices using OCR \(Optical Character Recognition\) and NLP \(Natural Language Processing\) as shown in the flowchart.  The processed data is then displayed on a dashboard with charts and tables, making it easy to understand and manage expenses. This system reduces manual work, saves time, and improves accuracy.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
